    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>40500</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030601</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>見つけたぞ！
えーと……ベルル！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There you are! Uhh... Berry!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>40940</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030602</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Beryl&gt;！　ボクは
&lt;Beryl&gt;＝ベニトだよっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It’s BERYL! Beryl Benito!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41120</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030603</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ゴメン。
オレは
&lt;Shing&gt;＝メテオライトです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, my bad. I’m Shing Meteoryte.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41444</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030604</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>このバカも俺も、チェンの仲間
じゃない。お前のスピリアを
少し探らせて欲しいだけなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lemme get this straight, neither me or this idiot are in cahoots with Chen. We just wanna take a quick peek in your Spiria to see if you’ve been telling the truth!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42600</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030605</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うそだ！　うそだ!!
ボクのソーマを取り上げに
来たんだろっ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Liars! You’re lying!! You’re just here to take my Soma away!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43372</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030606</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>きゃぁッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eeek!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44560</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030607</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>帰れ、チェンの手先どもめ！
帰らないと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You better back off, you lackeys! Back off, or I’ll...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030608</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんな筆でどうしようってんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What are you plannin’ to do with a brush that big?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44908</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030609</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うう、そ、それは……
この子の顔をベタベタにしてやる！
この絵具は一週間はとれないぞ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grr, w-well... I’ll get paint aaall over this poor girl’s face! It’ll take weeks to wash this off!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45460</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030610</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……悪い奴じゃなさそーだが
思念術を使われるとやっかいだ。
俺が気を引くから、その隙に……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...She doesn’t seem like a bad kid, but it might be trouble if she can use Will artes. I’ll distract her, then you can...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45796</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030611</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『帰る』って言ったら
信じてくれるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If I say we’ll leave you alone, would you trust me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46044</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030612</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>し、信じるもんか！
帰ったふりをして、襲う気だろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W-why should I?! You’re just gonna try and get me once my back is turned, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46308</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030613</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、どうすればいい？
どうすれば信じてくれる??
頼む、教えてくれよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then what should I do? What can I do to make you believe me?! Tell me, please!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46308</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030614</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>スピルーンを持ってる
きみの疑う気持ちは
&lt;Kohaku&gt;と同じはずなんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That feeling of doubt must be the same thing Kohaku’s Spirune feels!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46436</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030615</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ち、近寄るなぁ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>S-stay back!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46772</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030616</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そ、そんなの……
ボクにもわかんないよ!!
ボクだって教えて欲しいよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I- I don’t know... I don’t know anything! You should tell me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46900</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030617</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>真っ黒な気持ちが
吹き出してとまらないんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why can’t I stop these dark feelings from spilling outta me?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47236</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030618</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>誰も信じられないっ！
何も信じられないっ!!
自分だって信じられないっ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can’t trust anyone! I can’t believe anything! I can’t even trust myself!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47688</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030619</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こんなの……もう嫌だよぉ……
誰か……助けてよぉ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText> I can’t take it anymore... someone, please... make it stop...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47908</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030620</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……わかった。オレが
&lt;Beryl&gt;を助けるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I understand. Hisui, I’m going to save Beryl.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48132</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030621</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はっ、そんなにボコボコに
されたのに、お優しいこったな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ha, you’re being’ quite soft to someone who just beat the crap outta ya a second ago.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48464</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030622</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こんなの……この子や
&lt;Kohaku&gt;のスピリアの痛みに
比べたら、なんでもないさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That’s... This is nothing compared to the pain this girl and Kohaku’s Spiria has suffered.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48592</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030623</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>スピリア……痛い……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My Spiria... suffered...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49064</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S030624</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ちっ、仕方ねぇ
つきあってやるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Tch, whatever. I’m comin' too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51184</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031001</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>う、う〜ん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Urgh, hm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51312</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031002</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Beryl&gt;、気分はどう？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How do you feel, Beryl?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031003</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………別に。
普通……だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I’m...fine. It’s no biggie.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53016</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031004</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よぉ、どうやら
片付いたみてぇだな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ay, looks like everything’s settled?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53460</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031005</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>チェン！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chen!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53588</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031006</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おっとぉ、おめぇとの
ゴタゴタも終いだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey now, I already cleaned up our little mess.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53716</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031007</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……どういう事さ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...What does that mean?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54396</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031008</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こんにちは〜♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hello~♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54716</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031009</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この&lt;Ines&gt;さんがな
盗賊団を壊滅させて、奪われた
荷を全部奪い返してくれたのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ines here took out that pack of thieves and brought all my cargo back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54716</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031010</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よって、おめぇの失敗分の
貸しはチャラにしてやるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And, I’ll offer you a loan to cover your mess up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54940</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031011</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ええ!?
ホントに……いいの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh?! Is that...really OK?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55148</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031012</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おぉ!?　今回はやけに
簡単に信じるじゃねぇか！
一体どうしたんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa-ho?! You’re so quick to believe me this time. What’s going on?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55276</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031013</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Beryl&gt;のスピリアから
疑いのスピルーンを取り
出したんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We took back the Spirune of doubt that made its way into her Spira.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55404</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031014</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はぁ!?　よくわからねぇが
せっかくの強いスピリアを
弱めちまったって事だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Say what now?! I don’t really know what you’re on about, but sounds to me like you just weakened a perfectly strong Spiria.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031015</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……疑わないのは
スピリアが弱いの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Does not doubting make you Spiria weak?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55660</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031016</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おうよ。人を疑い、人から
疑われる事を恐れない強さで
俺はここまで成り上がったんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Course it does. Suspecting people, and not worrying what people think of me has given me the strength to make it this far.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55876</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031017</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>人を疑い、人から疑われる事を
恐れない強さ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Suspecting people and not being afraid of being suspected can be a kind of strength...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56004</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031018</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さて、これが『損害をソーマで
弁償する』とあった契約書です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, the contract also states that your Soma will be taken as compensation for damages.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031019</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……え？？？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Huh?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57192</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031020</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うふふ、盗賊退治の手間賃として
チェン大人から、あなたの
ソーマを譲ってもらったの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehe, Papa Chen here paid me for taking out those bandits with this Soma.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57192</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031021</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ソーマを差し出すのが嫌なら
代金は体で払ってね♪
……ま、詳細は後ほどゆっくり</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you don’t want to hand over your Soma, you’re free to repay me with your body♪ ...But, I’ll fill you in on the details later.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57360</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031022</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>がはは！　命を狙おうったって
今度は、盗賊団を壊滅させる人が
相手だぞぉ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gahaha! So if you try comin’ for me again, know you’ll have to go through this bandit basher first!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57360</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031023</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>な、簡単に人を信じても
ロクな事ぁねーだろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58628</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031024</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>な、なんだよそれ〜っ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What did you say?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58628</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031025</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うう……結局、ボクの
宮廷画家への夢はこれまで？
やっぱり誰も信じるもんかぁ〜！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grr... so in the end, my dream’s still in ruins? I knew it, you can’t trust anyone!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58756</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031026</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>元気出せよ、&lt;Beryl&gt;。
&lt;Ines&gt;さんは
悪い人じゃないから……多分</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Cheer up, Beryl. Ines here’s a good person... I think.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>59004</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031027</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……あんた、名前
なんてったっけ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You, what was your name again?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>59132</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031028</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;だよ。
&lt;Shing&gt;＝メテオライト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It’s Shing. Shing Meteoryte.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>59260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031029</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;！
乙女のスピリアに土足で入って
くれた恨み、忘れないからね!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shing! Don’t think I’ll forget you for barging into my Spiria with your shoes on!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60304</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031030</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あいつめ！　スピルーンと
関係なく、元々性格が
ねじ曲がってんじゃねぇか!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What’s with that kid? Even without the Spirune messin’ things up, she’s still a little brat!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>60624</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031031</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>顔に……字……書いてある</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She wrote... on your face...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61036</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031032</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『ア・リ・ガ・ト』</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>“Thanks”</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61240</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031033</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……あはは、やっぱり
&lt;Beryl&gt;って、いい奴だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Haha, I knew Beryl wasn’t so bad after all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61368</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031034</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そーか？
その絵具、一週間は
とれねぇって言ってたぞ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She did say that paint won’t wash off for a week though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>61660</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031035</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あうう、宿に帰って
顔洗わなきゃ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh oh, I gotta go scrub my face...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
